WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.500
06:00 — Airport phone. In the ride to the airport Hassan opens the trip on his phone — visa pinned with the itinerary, not lost in email.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:17.000
09:00 — Lounge iPad. Lounge iPad shows documents without digging through folders named “final_final_visa.”

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:25.500
21:00 — Hotel laptop. Hotel desk laptop drafts the next trip while this one is still warm; continuity instead of starting from zero.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:34.000
21:40 — Expenses. Expenses on the laptop are illustrative — enough to reclaim the month without a shoebox of receipts.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.500
22:00 — Phone. Phone tomorrow view. The visa lives with the trip. He sleeps.

